OL,3,ACould Somerset pub be the oldest in
OL,4,AEngland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuildings archaeologist Dr James Wright
OL,7,Fsaid science "pinpoints the
OL,8,Farchaeological development of the
OL,9,FGeorge Inn" to about 1430.
